  (text "How to read this schematic\nEach box is a page. Wires end in name tags (labels): any two tags with the same name are connected,\neven on different pages. The little arrows/bars marked +5V, +5VA, +3V3 and GND are power connections.\nPages: Power > Controller (Pico 2) > Sound chip (YM2612) > Audio out > Front panel." (at 30.48 140 0)
